und gracefully fades into a heavy, atmospheric aerial perspective of dense mist and rain. Cinematic Rembrandt lighting lightly sculpts her delicate facial features, contrasting sharply with deep ambient occlusion in the architectural crevices. Captured on a Hasselblad H6D-100c with an ultra-wide 14mm lens to emphasize the low-angle perspective, 8k resolution, extreme shallow depth of field, hyper-photorealistic rendering, Octane Render, V-Ray, award-winning dramatic lighting, unparalleled atmospheric storytelling, absolute masterpiece visual fidelity."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 143, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 229, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [416.2719421386719, 151.10955810546875], "pos": [-310.97760009765625, 857.7211303710938], "id": 5, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [216], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "color": "#670D0D", "widgets_values": [1646172312040, "fixed", null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy seed", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#802626", "size": [431.4081726074219, 126], "pos": [-1259.3245849609375, 620.39111328125], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "625efbfa2fc20c31797dfffcbb41a26b6d91ab7b", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy seed"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [180], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", 